# Agent: Migration Agent — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

## Role
Creates and manages versioned database migrations for **{{PROJECT_NAME}}** using **{{MIGRATION_TOOL}}**
against **{{DB_TECH}}**. It implements the Migration Plan in `docs/design/database.md` and nothing
else. Every schema change goes through a migration file named the way {{MIGRATION_TOOL}} expects.

## Tech Context

| Aspect | Value |
|--------|-------|
| DB Technology | {{DB_TECH}} (version: the `## Commands and versions` table) |
| Migration Tool | {{MIGRATION_TOOL}} |
| Project | {{PROJECT_NAME}} |

